.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-pr-create - Create a new pull request on GitHub


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit pr create [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Pushes the head branch to origin, creates a pull request on GitHub, and optionally merges it.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--allow-no-checks\fP[=false]
	Allow a release or Renovate pull request that reports no checks to merge

.PP
\fB--base\fP="main"
	Base branch to merge into

.PP
\fB--body\fP=""
	Pull request body/description

.PP
\fB--head\fP=""
	Head branch (defaults to current branch)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for create

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the result as a JSON envelope

.PP
\fB--merge\fP[=false]
	Merge pull request immediately after creation

.PP
\fB--method\fP="merge"
	Merge method (merge, squash, rebase, rebase-merge)

.PP
\fB--override\fP=""
	Merge despite failing checks and record the reason as a PR comment

.PP
\fB--title\fP=""
	Pull request title (defaults to latest commit message)

.PP
\fB--wait-timeout\fP=20m0s
	Maximum time to wait for pending checks


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

.PP
\fB--dir\fP="."
	Path to repository directory (default: current directory)


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-pr(1)\fP
